[I] A text object that escapes characters

[T] MarkupSafe implements a text object that escapes characters so it is
[T] safe to use in HTML and XML. Characters that have special meanings are
[T] replaced so that they display as the actual characters

[U] https://markupsafe.palletsprojects.com

